		{"id":"c1c1d1e1f10001","type":"text","text":"# LinuxSELinux\n\n**模块说明**：DAC→MAC + 4段标签 + 3模式 + fcontext/port/boolean + sealert 排错\n\n— 1 个笔记 —","x":-110,"y":-200,"width":280,"height":80,"color":"4"},
